# ==============================================================================
# SUMMARY OF CHANGES MADE POST-MST (AFTER SEPTEMBER 8, 2026)
# ==============================================================================
# Overview:
#   The Post-MST phase (Commits 65 to 79, Oct 28 - Nov 4, 2026) evolved notoLX
#   from a basic supply-only marketplace into an intelligent, dual-sided
#   matching platform featuring real-time email delivery, automated relevance
#   scanning, and a complete vintage editorial design overhaul.
#
# Key Architecture & Feature Deliverables:
#
# 1. CAMPUS ITEM REQUESTS & WANTED BOARD (Demand-Side Matching)
#    - Enabled students to post item requests when goods are unavailable.
#    - Components: CampusRequestsModal.jsx, CreateItemRequestModal.jsx.
#    - Backend: /api/item-requests API and Supabase item_requests schema with RLS.
#    - Stores requested item, category, max budget, and campus pickup spot.
#
# 2. AUTOMATED HEURISTIC MATCH DETECTION ENGINE
#    - Algorithmic relevance scoring in AppContext.jsx & smartSearch.js.
#    - Multi-tier matching criteria between listings and active requests:
#        a) Substring inclusion across title and description.
#        b) Tokenized relevance scoring (calculateListingRelevanceScore >= 20).
#        c) Significant keyword intersection (>= 3 chars).
#        d) Domain category matching.
#    - Two-way scan: scans existing listings upon request creation, and scans
#      active requests upon new listing creation.
#
# 3. PRODUCTION GMAIL SMTP REAL INBOX DELIVERY PIPELINE
#    - Integrated Nodemailer engine in server/emailService.js.
#    - Authenticated via smtp.gmail.com:465 with TLS/SSL encryption.
#    - Space-sanitized Google App Password support for zero-friction setup.
#    - Instant Request Confirmation: sends an immediate branded email confirming
#      that a student request is live on the board.
#    - Instant Match Alert: emails the requester with listing title, price,
#      condition, pickup spot, and direct chat link.
#    - Tri-environment API dispatch: Vite Dev Server Connect middleware,
#      Express backend, and Vercel Serverless Functions.
#
# 4. BESPOKE VINTAGE EDITORIAL PRINT REDESIGN
#    - Replaced flat modern theme with a tactile Vintage Parchment & Maroon theme.
#    - Custom high-res handmade cotton rag paper background with torn deckle
#      borders (public/marketplace-bg.jpg) on warm ivory base (#F2E8DC).
#    - Distressed dry-brush maroon brand typography (notolx-distressed-logo.png).
#    - Harmonized palette: --bg-app (#F3E6DD), --bg-card (#E8DCCF),
#      --primary (#5E2424 Thapar Maroon), --text-main (#221616).
#    - Frosted semi-transparent sticky navbar with backdrop-filter blur.
#
# 5. CODE GOVERNANCE & DEVELOPER WORKFLOW
#    - Added AGENTS.md specifying strict Git collaboration protocols
#      (fetch/pull before work, explicit user confirmation before commit/push).
#
# Cumulative Post-MST Code Delta:
#    26 files changed, 2,051 insertions(+), 434 deletions(-)
